  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Each truck controls a real paddle station. Drive for forward/reverse strokes;
    steer changes stroke angle; ACTION rights a capsize. AI partners follow a human''s
    actual cadence. River Sprint: quickest full crossing. Rapid Rally: tighter gates
    and a physical fork. Choose the orange log shortcut or green shallow channel;
    missing both branch gates adds three seconds. Ordinary misses and collision/capsize
    penalties still apply. Canoe Chaos: only the canoe providing greater closing
    momentum earns a bump; capsizing an opponent adds a bonus. Team Paddle Challenge:
    synchronization counts only while moving forward and upright; accurate gates
    also score. Partners share their canoe''s result.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
